# Theme Configuration

## Colors

<!-- @project-config:colors -->
```scss
// Palette (optional)
$blue: #1f2261;

// Brand / semantic
$primary-color: #1f2261;
$secondary-color: #fdba00;
$success-color: #33b469;
$info-color: #ebbc2e;
$warning-color: #ebbc2e;

// Typography
$body-color: #080c11;
$heading-color: inherit;
$link-color: $body-color;
$link-hover-color: inherit;
```
<!-- @end -->

## Typography

<!-- @project-config:fonts -->
```scss
$serif: 'Source Serif Pro', georgia, serif;
$sans-serif: 'Oldschool Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
$body-font-size: rem-calc(16);
$body-font-family: $serif;
$heading-font-family: $sans-serif;
$paragraph-line-height: 1.5;
$paragraph-margin-block-end: rem-calc(32);
$heading-margin-block-end: rem-calc(32);
```
<!-- @end -->

<!-- @project-config:heading-scale -->
### Heading Scale (fluid)

```scss
h1: fluid(44, 72)     h2: fluid(36, 64)     h3: fluid(32, 56)
h4: fluid(24, 40)     h5: fluid(20, 32)     h6: fluid(16, 24)
```

### Display Scale (fluid)

```scss
display-1: fluid(72, 160)
display-2: fluid(60, 120)
display-3: fluid(40, 80)
```
<!-- @end -->

## Breakpoints

<!-- @project-config:breakpoints -->
```scss
$xs: 0px      $ph: 375px    $sm: 576px
$md: 768px    $lg: 1024px   $xl: 1200px
$xxl: 1400px  $xxxl: 1600px
```
<!-- @end -->

## Container

<!-- @project-config:container -->
```scss
// Max-widths by breakpoint:
// ph/sm: 100%, md: 95vw, lg/xl/xxl: 93vw, xxxl: 90rem (1440px)
// Padding: fluid(20, 40)  ($container-padding-x)
```
<!-- @end -->

## Section Spacing Classes

<!-- @project-config:spacing -->
| Class                                            | Value             |
| ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- |
| `.spacing-top-small` / `.spacing-bottom-small`   | `fluid(20, 40)`   |
| `.spacing-top-medium` / `.spacing-bottom-medium` | `fluid(40, 70)`   |
| `.spacing-top-large` / `.spacing-bottom-large`   | `fluid(70, 140)`  |
| `.spacing-top-xlarge` / `.spacing-bottom-xlarge` | `fluid(100, 160)` |
<!-- @end -->

